Cucina @VERSION@ — a managed [Buildbarn](https://github.com/buildbarn) distribution for Bazel remote execution and caching.

## Install

| What | Where |
| --- | --- |
| Helm chart | `helm install cucina oci://ghcr.io/@OWNER@/charts/cucina --version @VERSION@` |
| Controller image | `ghcr.io/@OWNER@/cucina-controller:@VERSION@` (pinned by digest in the chart) |
| STS image | `ghcr.io/@OWNER@/cucina-sts:@VERSION@` |
| `cucinactl` | `brew install @OWNER@/tap/cucinactl`, or the archives below (macOS arm64, Linux x86_64/arm64 static, Windows x86_64) |
| macOS hosts | `cucina-host-@CORE_DASHED@.pkg` + manifest `cucina-host-@CORE_DASHED@.plist` for MDM (see `docs/macos/mac-mini-setup.md`) |
| Worker agent | `cucina-worker-agent-@VERSION@-<os>-<arch>` for worker images (`workers/*/Makefile WORKER_AGENT=…`) |

## Verify

```sh
sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS                       # or: shasum -a 256 -c SHA256SUMS
gh attestation verify <asset> --repo @REPOSITORY@
gh attestation verify oci://ghcr.io/@OWNER@/cucina-controller:@VERSION@ --repo @REPOSITORY@
```

